      "walkthrough": [
        "Evaluate $f'(x) = 6x^{-1/2} - 4x^{-3/2}$ at $x = 4$:\n$$f'(4) = 6(4)^{-1/2} - 4(4)^{-3/2} = 6\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) - 4\\left(\\frac{1}{8}\\right) = 3 - 0.5 = 2.5 = \\frac{5}{2}$$",
